WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.675
Think of the executive and assistant as a working partnership. The executive

00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:07.350
sets the business direction. The assistant turns that direction into organised, dependable

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:11.025
support.

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:14.858
The two work products named on screen are your destination: a working

00:00:14.858 --> 00:00:18.450
agreement and a priority decision brief. You will build them through the

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:22.042
unit rather than just read about them.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:26.075
Meridian and its people are fictional. Practise making reasons visible, checking uncertainty

00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:29.883
and asking the right person. A course example does not give you

00:00:29.883 --> 00:00:33.692
workplace authority.
